<title>HONG KONG: Citybus announces first final results.</title>
<headline>Citybus announces first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	     15.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)	nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    4.33 gain</p>
<p>    Net				118.77</p>
<p>    Turnover			 807.25</p>
<p>    Company name		   Citybus Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		    N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	     N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Citybus Group, the bus operation unit of CNT Group Ltd, was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on November 29, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on interest income derived from share application monies received during initial public offering period of the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
